# Secrets for MCP servers on THIS machine only. Never synced, mode 600.
# One KEY=value per line. A value may be a 1Password reference (op://vault/item/field);
# then the 1Password CLI resolves every line at launch.
# An MCP entry uses a key as ${KEY}, or ${KEY:-} when the key is optional.
#
# LINEAR_API_KEY=
# POSTHOG_API_KEY=op://Private/posthog/credential
